abstract: "Give 3D AI agents a voice and a face from any MCP client — text-to-speech, speech-to-text, audio-to-face lipsync (ARKit blendshapes), and the motion-capture clip library. Read-only over the live three.ws API; free NVIDIA lanes, no key required."
